{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB台慶劇《璀璨之城》昨日（10月27日）播出的第12集中，黃子恆與蔣家旻上演了一幕挑戰電視尺度的鴛鴦浴戲份，引發觀眾及網民討論。</p><p>劇中蔣家旻飾演官家大小姐官詩雅，黃子恆則飾演Ken。該集劇情講述在姜大衞的角色去世後，官詩雅決定採取行動，打算與周志康（飾演Felix）離婚，並正式與Ken雙宿雙飛。在浴室的對手戲中，蔣家旻在鏡頭前除去浴衣，與黃子恆共浴。期間蔣家旻詢問黃子恆是否有辦法將周志康踢走，黃子恆反問：「你想我坐Felix個位？定還是你想我頂佢做你老公個位？」該幕戲份將兩人的野心與情感關係展現出來，成為劇集焦點之一。</p><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻脫去衣服露出白滑玉背，再緩緩走到浴缸中。（節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1191921998088376320152347.jpeg/dWJ0949Rxnj5mvgHgWSmriXSSaALx1pwH0LUvR9C1L0\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻脫去衣服露出白滑玉背，再緩緩走到浴缸中。（節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻黃子恆在泡泡中依偎著。（節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261028/1191921995760406528392185.jpeg/K4aF3rQpFl2CL4X-F_Ykf_pkvWkwgCaSdzJ9M3cyfTM\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻黃子恆在泡泡中依偎著。（節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>首擔正電影《第一次不是你》半裸露背</p><p>事實上，這並非蔣家旻首次在演出中作出大膽突破。回顧其演藝生涯，早在2013年由葉念琛執導的電影《第一次不是你》中，蔣家旻首次擔正女主角飾演「鄺美寶（阿寶）」，與馬志威合作。戲中角色為籌措患上腎衰竭母親（江美儀飾）的高昂手術費而下海援交。蔣家旻在電影中有不少突破性演出，包括半裸露背、換衫鏡頭，以及與男主角重逢後的情慾戲份，她亦憑該片獲得「第33屆香港電影金像獎」最佳新演員提名。</p><figure><img alt=\"戲中蔣家旻不下一次要脫剩內衣。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693145431281664978160.jpeg/0oVhOzZBh0ZK7yAPuTjJvF_qmMc9w0zf2msOztprDs4\"/><figcaption>戲中蔣家旻不下一次要脫剩內衣。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"片尾蔣家旻與馬志威的情慾場面，可謂葉念琛電影宇宙中最大膽。（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153527735980032370689.jpeg/GmBYQ-mRJFwr0GbXrw2a8qABNL9K7HsnXhiJJl4YiSY\"/><figcaption>片尾蔣家旻與馬志威的情慾場面，可謂葉念琛電影宇宙中最大膽。（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153519493648384410239.jpeg/2chTL_szO_U25tmMGgXDwWCYSQ7C7hzuUySUG1MklBs\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>點解下圖睇蔣家旻大膽演出：</p><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻在戲中多數以背心look登場。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693742305906688390251.jpeg/vJ6QurFHMxY5hGuBTy0qLXBunanfc6DbG-7V7Bvu1ew\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻在戲中多數以背心look登場。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻在戲中多數以背心look登場。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693744931672064163475.jpeg/WdlZi3ArQkdyr1H7CP3_Jy_qvvK5T_0w0BQUU9AUFFM\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻在戲中多數以背心look登場。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻在戲中不失性感。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693749788938240825649.jpeg/c3c9HFG7D6HpomEYCuoIKuoUoSCfox4NVVM8nlVTPJ4\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻在戲中不失性感。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻瞓到遲到。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693754629427200485916.jpeg/1YthJjS0RyGvYY-buTqa02vZWJo8EUy-RsOmRkbDpkY\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻瞓到遲到。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"要急於換衫出門。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693757750120448743109.jpeg/8rJDcZIwEeBN8zTYxrD0hRRUuKQUNo31mf_zPJn_8zw\"/><figcaption>要急於換衫出門。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"這一幕令她大露玉背。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693760543657984093628.jpeg/AeCYBTK24UNGpDe9md1BP9M_843DVKxaZUgQI2VIECM\"/><figcaption>這一幕令她大露玉背。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693762783547392159247.jpeg/wG3INqhiXP9zvUB5BYriyMJ4BNmc7-0M_RAtdv0QLXY\"/><figcaption>（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻當年24歲。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693766260756480518647.jpeg/Q9opQ5b0l8fjZp2xIw0AuCntBAtKU8eZyUCR5slAkeY\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻當年24歲。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻當年24歲。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693752355983360689130.jpeg/veLup0lr2wi5_jiDXAkcuJVGhxS6qRvootTMNqLUzDY\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻當年24歲。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"24歲的蔣家旻，演技都算不錯。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693741332828160384709.jpeg/yU9LAhFBkIXfRsqnBuP0yk4V9prWD9ZlE5FL5hORS-Y\"/><figcaption>24歲的蔣家旻，演技都算不錯。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693746072653824483290.jpeg/rn2IbpBlXNmDxZPH1cBnhJ4jVH5t8j6CfFEwjnxRMI4\"/><figcaption>（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有不少浪漫場面。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693748237045760826430.jpeg/hIBgi4jgwip_T9IrueB_jooWqYgIOWeKH2kpTR9pKU0\"/><figcaption>有不少浪漫場面。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻本來打算去做援交前，為馬志威獻出自己的第一次。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693750699233280102937.jpeg/hF9dDxWKVo50gb0yF9_A21GHt4RS0WpwPCqcWTwqnFk\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻本來打算去做援交前，為馬志威獻出自己的第一次。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻本來打算去做援交前，為馬志威獻出自己的第一次。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693752825876480410689.jpeg/LHgVxTkdcJQVrPw7gF88oI3I7jjUScNgjFl3eoxZd3o\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻本來打算去做援交前，為馬志威獻出自己的第一次。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻本來打算去做援交前，為馬志威獻出自己的第一次。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693755116097536184769.jpeg/0yiffHGowWHQiIuuPxrnZ1q1VaM3uJ0eXrJURV6yVEU\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻本來打算去做援交前，為馬志威獻出自己的第一次。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻在戲中多數以背心look登場。（影片擷圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210112/425693760006918144470915.jpeg/kh_EZGrnihKMnITr5PVBt9dvVHv65hjVbRDkNm0Q5DY\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻在戲中多數以背心look登場。（影片擷圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153514988703744548216.png/vXQYAaxBbFm2fwjXAZAXj-jtvDtoenOan66C45-uguM\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153517312479232324916.jpeg/IjOH-qhFq0sHVBJjK8gEQMRdT591mVXmNxwmODccJjg\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153519413956608240691.jpeg/h1nlavM_qbh-Moju2hxyjiKAdCZyqmwtiGZgC4hmYAs\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153522001973248328914.jpeg/DNQft2voM76cWI-RsF48T6VpwSoeceNm6lCw5epQsOU\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153524137005056543816.jpeg/Iig2xcA9mFyBN2BPoAoEm_mMj4_F-KLmuK8QCbivEAk\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153526947319808960358.jpeg/P7ky_EbkYGhDoWCsFPlgCpOvBhFV96PMdzNh1HczYdQ\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153530575523840142039.jpeg/6bd1tvRdE6iVt-y1XKdB7kY4Z8VR2u8tLjJczS4yXM0\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153533083848704215947.jpeg/yCSO2aupJHUxbjSDzBuC6SC5xp4Oy3MGYQDRIGEA0SA\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153535533453312698152.jpeg/cbGFLKCD-X0nY0vj24OJ3qtZ57-p-XqBo1TIsaNUyLE\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153538733838336384796.jpeg/XwjdpOYAXur9XHeLoSCaYhoL_sEsOMkNoGDSCKBg0gg\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153514992898048038491.jpeg/fGO_EfPJz1dBz5lZ8qwmReKusOU7_XcBBj9M1AY_TNQ\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153517476057088761530.jpeg/gxGTDXSwp5xd_aYLhVgOlhHsTFZ_mgTePh3I_j4dyP4\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153519820804096439150.jpeg/uW6BIORvkot4NfyfZ-1OgoqrQlhPzFhQGJhWvhiYVr4\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153521792258048548913.jpeg/rr21lu4pncrG6v-9eDmMAsQ_R3fIhuRvwDWY18A1mNc\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153523897929728497365.jpeg/8IYrUB2g9iUk4KSpFI1pduoL1RWkwXP4ntiswZ7YrME\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153526464974848706281.jpeg/7arluLmT0bOQtrAtjl9Cw1w_WDLu5LjUhgDMDYYAzA0\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153528411262976413082.jpeg/8hycSBnDTllZ_H9QWmnuORrEAjDoThx7J_DbVCfw21Q\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153530948947968107856.jpeg/KYv0oQiHYybCJcq2pr942kBlYah-GT4h9QniAfUJ4gE\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153533054619648638417.jpeg/G5rNIeJolKy3oFSQizNglI2BWgOUrWpSFcreAhXK3gI\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153535164485632643195.jpeg/PYN1p_k87IE6kQ0bLa2-bR_QM4khzI_UdWYgCnVmIAo\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153514909011968349510.jpeg/wjIfnhhn03L8RKpUkgh4fC4BXwmCCtwkEBXlQBAV5UA\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153517207621632754693.jpeg/1AyYv_SAvFX5LNi-tshm_BppD9n-LkO9Re7T8UXu0_E\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153519493648384410239.jpeg/2chTL_szO_U25tmMGgXDwWCYSQ7C7hzuUySUG1MklBs\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153521569959936642853.jpeg/b_AU0uHBM09VKjOwbS-nUMzTtX49H1i9AY3CGAGNwhg\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153523738546176795263.jpeg/ea8St68BSK94iXppy9dmco1DFlkoxYKOCvPregrz63o\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153525638696960170435.jpeg/P-GJBtABBRTDjmMN_9DhNMzcVdR3X_0SlH_9S5R__Us\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153527735980032370689.jpeg/GmBYQ-mRJFwr0GbXrw2a8qABNL9K7HsnXhiJJl4YiSY\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153529644519424743286.jpeg/onI4Sx_HzA4YL_JdpPCDAJXK7gwEAPDRNwJKeDcCSng\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153531775356928847361.jpeg/J60p7HMb-5eQjXbgwMEb2kap5H_ZNPbCcJ28lXCdvJU\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（電影截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221007/655153533792948224124803.jpeg/vXjwYQIthVZnyIFbMf0wPW7fQI_OFi620LNYh9CzWIc\"/><figcaption>（電影截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>《美麗戰場》演「反骨琪」慘遭迷姦</p><p>而在2022年播出的TVB劇集《美麗戰場》中，蔣家旻飾演的「反骨琪」（鍾家琪）同樣有一幕備受談論的被姦戲份。當時劇情講述她原本計劃將陳瀅飾演的家寶迷暈，安排由李成昌飾演的威爺將其強姦；然而手下叛變將兩人掉包，最終蔣家旻的角色被迷暈並遭到強姦。蔣家旻事後受訪時透露，拍攝該場戲前承受不少壓力，並感謝對手李成昌事前與她做足溝通，讓她能放心完成演出。</p><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896753667706880253019.jpeg/PzX3_I4wNPriQUS-GJ-qwQUenR0iGnYcHEQIJxxECCc\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻 (《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661301820110409728170695.jpeg/d53Y39JpLayb81S8BvwwoNBWQPPEUklBAhA2WgIQNlo\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻 (《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>點解下圖睇蔣家旻被迷姦的演出：</p><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻決定留下等李成昌的到來，(《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896739603419136386974.jpeg/NYHSJTpEZjoh3QzitLP1r67YVvVZhIgNg9aP5YPWj-U\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻決定留下等李成昌的到來，(《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"更說要拍下影片公開讓人知道陳瀅被強姦 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896742048829440691874.jpeg/DkhVLFh6Lwc_56hEO2Zso1Rme1c1UIqjCZHQbwmR0G8\"/><figcaption>更說要拍下影片公開讓人知道陳瀅被強姦 (《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"結果蔣家旻在通知李成昌後喝了一點酒便倒下 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896744464879616754039.jpeg/sp2tmaGse2Jye_j8RF16nP4hMosDTnmQrfBFgq3wRYI\"/><figcaption>結果蔣家旻在通知李成昌後喝了一點酒便倒下 (《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"結果是李成昌來到酒店後見到蔣家旻已經在攤倒床上，(《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896746625077248073961.jpeg/6qz3OtFkrGOvryAG3X7J2gbwgaQtW-KZ6T9Tduk_U3Y\"/><figcaption>結果是李成昌來到酒店後見到蔣家旻已經在攤倒床上，(《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻已經在攤倒床上等待 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896748923686912726849.jpeg/SrxZspHTdvjBjm84eg6K8TiE2ngVDNL04XwEo-F8BKM\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻已經在攤倒床上等待 (《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻醒來後見到李成昌 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896751255851008693015.jpeg/PJgHihj-1VF8HqtjXobUVSbTQsXB_KPfTtW8HE7VvBw\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻醒來後見到李成昌 (《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔣家旻 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896753667706880253019.jpeg/PzX3_I4wNPriQUS-GJ-qwQUenR0iGnYcHEQIJxxECCc\"/><figcaption>蔣家旻 (《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李成昌已經顧不得是誰 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/659896756004065280319745.jpeg/G2A7oA8tKJd5syP1_7vYeTfS_JGxcG6sQoSaGUKEmhk\"/><figcaption>李成昌已經顧不得是誰 (《美麗戰場》截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李成昌飛擒大咬 (《美麗戰場》截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221020/65989675831